          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Chisha nchilonda kumanya mana kuhusu ro dzinyama ra ne rokala tafwauti na madzinyama ganjina. Dzinyama riro kala rinaogofya sana, naro kala rina meno ga chuma na kombe za shaba. Riri kala rina meno makulu ga chuma na kombe za shaba, naro rarya na kuvundza-vundza maaduige, na richivyoga-vyoga chokala chikasala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya nauza kuhusu zo pembe kumi zokala zi phakpwe chitswani na kuhusu yo pembe yanjina yomera badaye na ichihenda pembe tahu zigbwe. Pembe iyo kala ni kulu kuriko zo zanjina na kala ina matso na mromo uriogomba maneno ga kudzikarya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
